<title>GERMANY: Merck says five-month sales up 13.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Merck says five-month sales up 13.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DARMSTADT, Germany 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Five months to May 31, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group sales				  3,224   vs 2,845</p>
<p>Of which:</p>
<p>    --pharmaceutical sales		   1,873   vs 1,571</p>
<p>    --specialty chemicals		    602     vs 544</p>
<p>    --laboratory				 728     vs 695</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German pharmaceuticals and chmemicals group is Merck KGaA. The numbers were release in conjunction with the group's annual meeting.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
